<h3 class="flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id="7-query-multiple-vectors"><div class="absolute" tabindex="-1"><a href="#7-query-multiple-vectors" class="-ml-10 flex items-center opacity-0 border-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus:opacity-100 focus:outline-0 group/link" aria-label="Navigate to header">​<div class="size-6 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-white/50 dark:bg-background-dark dark:brightness-[1.35] dark:ring-1 dark:hover:brightness-150 bg-white ring-1 ring-gray-400/30 dark:ring-gray-700/25 hover:ring-gray-400/60 dark:hover:ring-white/20 group-focus/link:border-2 group-focus/link:border-primary dark:group-focus/link:border-primary-light"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3 shrink-0"><path d="M8.50001 6.827C8.14801 6.995 7.81801 7.225 7.52701 7.517L7.51701 7.527C6.13601 8.908 6.13601 11.146 7.51701 12.527L9.69201 14.702C11.073 16.083 13.311 16.083 14.692 14.702L14.702 14.692C16.083 13.311 16.083 11.073 14.702 9.692L13.771 8.761" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9.50002 11.173C9.85202 11.005 10.182 10.775 10.473 10.483L10.483 10.473C11.864 9.092 11.864 6.854 10.483 5.473L8.30802 3.298C6.92702 1.917 4.68902 1.917 3.30802 3.298L3.29802 3.308C1.91702 4.689 1.91702 6.927 3.29802 8.308L4.22902 9.239" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></a></div><span class="cursor-pointer">7. Query Multiple Vectors</span></h3>
<span data-as="p">With multiple query vectors, LanceDB calculates similarity using late interaction, a late-interaction technique that computes relevance by finding the best-matching pairs between query and document vectors. This approach provides more nuanced matching while maintaining fast retrieval speeds.</span>
<div data-orientation="horizontal" data-activation-direction="none" class="code-group p-0.5 mt-5 mb-8 flex flex-col not-prose relative rounded-2xl border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 min-w-0 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-white/5 dark:codeblock-dark text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-50 codeblock-light"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 relative pr-2.5" data-component-part="code-group-tab-bar"><div role="presentation" style="position:relative;--scroll-area-corner-height:0px;--scroll-area-corner-width:0px" data-component-part="scroll-area" class="min-w-0 flex-1 w-0 rounded-tl-xl"><div data-id="base-ui-_R_5jpbb9qnpfb39p7b9snpfiutb_-viewport" tabindex="-1" class="size-full rounded-[inherit] [--scroll-area-fade-size:32px] overflow-y-hidden! base-ui-disable-scrollbar" style="overflow:scroll" data-component-part="scroll-area-viewport"><div role="presentation" style="min-width:fit-content" data-component-part="scroll-area-content"><div data-orientation="horizontal" data-activation-direction="none" role="tablist" aria-label="Code examples" class="text-xs leading-6 gap-1 flex"><button type="button" data-active="" data-orientation="horizontal" data-activation-direction="none" aria-disabled="false" tabindex="-1" role="tab" aria-selected="true" id="base-ui-_R_mljpbb9qnpfb39p7b9snpfiutb_" data-composite-item-active="" class="group flex items-center relative gap-1.5 my-1 mb-1.5 outline-0 whitespace-nowrap font-medium ml-0! first:ml-2.5! focus-visible:outline-hidden text-primary dark:text-primary-light"><div class="peer/title flex items-center gap-1.5 px-1.5 rounded-lg z-10 group-focus-visible:outline-1 group-focus-visible:outline-primary dark:group-focus-visible:outline-primary-light"><svg class="forced-colors:forced-color-adjust-none forced-colors:bg-[color:CanvasText]! h-3.5 w-3.5 bg-gray-500 dark:bg-gray-400 group-hover:bg-primary dark:group-hover:bg-primary-light code-block-icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" style="-webkit-mask-image:url(&quot;https://d3gk2