NN safety check applies a stricter row threshold to multivector columns — roughly 10× lower than for single-vector columns. So an unindexed multivector table can be rejected with a “vector search would use brute-force KNN” error well before a comparable single-vector table would. LanceDB Enterprise doesn’t have the limit. Build the index before you start hitting it from production traffic, even if the dataset is small enough that you’d skip indexing for a single-vector workload.`})]}),`\n`,_jsx(Heading,{level:`3`,id:`6-query-a-single-vector`,children:`6. Query a Single Vector`}),`\n`,_jsx(_components.p,{children:`When searching with a single query vector, it will be compared against all vectors in each document, and the similarity scores will be aggregated to find the most relevant documents.`}),`\n`,_jsx(CodeGroup,{children:_jsx(CodeBlock,{filename:`Python`,icon:`python`,numberOfLines:`2`,language:`python`,children:_jsx(_components.pre,{className:`shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light catppuccin-mocha`,style:{backgroundColor:`#ffffff`,\"--shiki-dark-bg\":`#1e1e2e`,color:`#393a34`,\"--shiki-dark\":`#cdd6f4`},language:`python`,children:_jsxs(_components.code,{language:`python`,numberOfLines:`2`,children:[_jsxs(_components.span,{className:`line`,children:[_jsx(_components.span,{style:{color:`#393A34`,\"--shiki-dark\":`#CDD6F4`},children:`query `}),_jsx(_components.span,{style:{color:`#999999`,\"--shiki-dark\":`#94E2D5`},children:`=`}),_jsx(_components.span,{style:{color:`#393A34`,\"--shiki-dark\":`#CDD6F4`},children:` np`}),_jsx(_components.span,{style:{color:`#999999`,\"--shiki-dark\":`#9399B2`},children:`.`}),_jsx(_components.span,{style:{color:`#393A34`,\"--shiki-dark\":`#CDD6F4`},children:`random`}),_jsx(_components.span,{style:{color:`#999999`,\"--shiki-dark\":`#9399B2`},children:`.`}),_jsx(_components.span,{style:{color:`#393A34`,\"--shiki-dark\":`#89B4FA`},children:`random`}),_jsx(_components.span,{style:{color:`#999999`,\"--shiki-dark\":`#9399B2`},children:`(`}),_j